### VS Code REST Client: ejecuta en orden; sustituye los IDs de las respuestas.
@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = PEGAR_ACCESS_TOKEN
@business = PEGAR_ID_NEGOCIO
@wallet = PEGAR_ID_CARTERA
@list = PEGAR_ID_LISTA
@item = PEGAR_ID_ARTICULO

### Registrar usuario (email único)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Mi usuario","email":"admin@example.com","password":"CambiaEstaClave123!"}

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@example.com","password":"CambiaEstaClave123!"}

### Crear negocio; copiar _id a @business
POST {{base}}/businesses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Mi negocio","currency":"MXN","timezone":"America/Mexico_City"}

### Crear cartera; copiar _id a @wallet
POST {{base}}/businesses/{{business}}/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-wallet-0001

{"name":"Caja principal","kind":"cash","openingBalanceMinor":500000}

### Crear lista flexible; copiar _id a @list
POST {{base}}/businesses/{{business}}/inventory-lists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Materiales","fields":[{"key":"color","label":"Color","type":"text","required":true}]}

### Crear artículo; copiar _id a @item
POST {{base}}/businesses/{{business}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Tela","unit":"metro","listIds":["{{list}}"],"values":{"color":"Azul"},"priceMinor":8500,"costMinor":4000}

### Entrada de 25 metros; usar revision del artículo recién creado
POST {{base}}/businesses/{{business}}/items/{{item}}/adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-stock-0001

{"deltaMilli":25000,"reason":"Compra inicial","revision":1}

### Venta de 1.5 metros con descuento de 10%; reintentar misma clave no duplica
POST {{base}}/businesses/{{business}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-sale-0001

{"walletId":"{{wallet}}","lines":[{"itemId":"{{item}}","quantityMilli":1500}],"discount":{"type":"percent","value":1000,"reason":"Cliente frecuente"},"description":"Venta de tela azul"}

### Egreso de 100.00
POST {{base}}/businesses/{{business}}/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-expense-0001

{"walletId":"{{wallet}}","kind":"expense","amountMinor":10000,"category":"Transporte","description":"Entrega de pedido"}

### Cotización (no afecta dinero ni stock)
POST {{base}}/businesses/{{business}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Cotización de materiales","lines":[{"itemId":"{{item}}","quantityMilli":3000}],"expiresOn":"2099-12-31","discount":{"type":"fixed","value":1000,"reason":"Convenio"}}

### Proyección
POST {{base}}/businesses/{{business}}/projections/calculate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Escenario base","months":12,"initialInvestmentMinor":300000,"unitPriceMinor":15000,"unitCostMinor":7000,"quantityMilli":100000,"monthlyGrowthBps":500,"discountBps":500,"salesFeeBps":300,"fixedMonthlyMinor":250000}

### Historial; ajusta at a un instante pasado con zona
GET {{base}}/businesses/{{business}}/history?collection=wallets&at=2026-10-01T23:59:59.999Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Auditoría
GET {{base}}/businesses/{{business}}/audit?limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resumen
GET {{base}}/businesses/{{business}}/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Finalizar sesión
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
